Hello, Steam! Our digital board game is finally available for purchase!

[i]Fated Kingdom - a digital board game for 4 people, which does not put the player in the rigid framework of scripts and algorithms. To survive in a dismal world and save the kingdom of Kinmar, the participants of the game will have to throw dice, take cards from the deck and move the pieces on the board.[/i]

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32623881/81d27965b9aae2f447cd98ceabc8f16ff1725834.jpg[/img]

[b]Game Features:[/b]
[list]
[*]Classic tabletop experience in digital form;
[*]4 player co-op;
[*]Sandbox with no forced rules;
[*]Realistic physics;
[*]Dark and cruel fantasy world.[/list]

We are sure that hard work and careful attention to feedback will help us make a worthy game. For us, this is also important because we ourselves want to play it, see it as positive changes, and also be part of a friendly community.

We will be happy to receive feedback of any kind - suggestions, criticism, advice and just feedback.

The game is already [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/837400/Fated_Kingdom/]available[/url] on Steam at a price of 205 rubles. Also, there is a 10% discount until June 4. Have fun!
